  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Sisters of Sacred Hearts of Jesus and Mary (Chigwell) PROJECT: The aim  is to provide climate-resilient livelihoods, vocational training, promote quality inclusive education, health,  and advocacy for justice and human rights for vulnerable populations, especially the for the furthest behind communities. Key activities include training in 
 diversified livelihood opportunities to help boost income, food, and nutrition security for households with Children with Special Needs.</narrative>
